# License admin dashboard environment (copy to .env.local and adjust if needed)
#
# ── VITE_LICENSE_SERVER_URL ──
# LEAVE IT UNSET / EMPTY IN DEVELOPMENT.
#
# When empty, src/lib/api.ts uses RELATIVE paths (/license-admin/..., /v1/...).
# The Vite dev server proxies those to the License Server on :8081 — see the
# `server.proxy` block in vite.config.ts. Because the browser then makes a
# same-origin request, CORS never applies. This is the intended dev setup.
#
# Setting an absolute origin here makes every call cross-origin again, so that
# origin MUST also appear in the backend's CORS_ORIGIN allowlist
# (backend/.env), or the browser will block it. See R-01 in REMEDIATION_LOG.md.
#
# ⚠️ PRODUCTION: a built static bundle has no Vite dev server, so nothing
# proxies these paths. Either
#   (a) serve the bundle behind a real reverse proxy (nginx/Caddy) that forwards
#       /license-admin and /v1 to the License Server — keeps it same-origin, or
#   (b) set VITE_LICENSE_SERVER_URL below AND add this dashboard's origin to
#       the backend's CORS_ORIGIN list.
#
# VITE_LICENSE_SERVER_URL=https://licenses.example.com
